WEBVTT

00:33:26.788 --> 00:33:31.413
there won't be any other person for them.
That is the exact same phenomenon.

00:33:31.538 --> 00:33:36.579
It's like you have to have this belief
that there is something out there worth

00:33:36.579 --> 00:33:39.871
finding. And so if what you're
doing now is mediocre,

00:33:40.621 --> 00:33:43.163
it's worth stopping to find
that thing. That's not.

00:33:44.538 --> 00:33:46.996
If you normalize failure
in your organization,

00:33:47.204 --> 00:33:50.288
it can help people de-escalate their
commitment to bad decisions

00:33:50.413 --> 00:33:52.996
and focus their energy on
better opportunities,

00:33:53.746 --> 00:33:56.121
because Kathy pulled the plug on Foghorn.

00:33:56.371 --> 00:34:00.496
She was able to pursue a new project which
eventually launched her career